<title>USA: U.S. meat output 16.2 pct above a week ago - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. meat output 16.2 pct above a week ago - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Red meat production for week ending Saturday, June 7, 820.7 million lbs, up 16.2. - USDA</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING/1  BEEF   CALF/VEAL   PORK/2  LAMB/MUTTON  TOTALS/3</p>
